(level-flip-flops "XII MEMORIA" 22 "A8:A11" "J3" (test-bit (- (row) 2)))
(level-lamps "XII MEMORIA" "L3:L6")
(rules "XII MEMORIA" ("M3:M6" Lab!M51))
(cells "XII MEMORIA"
  ("N1" "MEMORIA, memory: four flip-flops, a register: with load at 1, q' is d; with load at 0, q' is q. J3:J6, low bit first.")
  ("N2" "Four of XI. Ctrl+K writes a formula over a range: (formula \"XII MEMORIA\" \"J3:J6\" \"=IF($A$3,A4,A8)\") fills all four.")
  ("N3" "Cicero called memory the treasury of all things (De Oratore I.18). Here the treasury is four bits, with a lid."))
